  "body": "…governance\r\n\r\nGame layer (no build step, native ES modules):\r\n- engine/ — seeded RNG (shared browser+Node), RAF loop, pointer drag, GameHost\r\n- Arcade hub (#/arcade) with two flagship games: Substitution (drag-to-solve cryptogram) and Hash Miner (idle, offline progress)\r\n- Replay-verified arcade leaderboard: games/sim/* are pure logic imported by both the browser and .github/scripts/verify-arcade.mjs, so scores are recomputed from the move-log, not trusted (workflow + issue template + data/arcade-*)\r\n- Per-phase games (games/phasegames.js): every door playable via a data-driven `play` field — assemble (P1 lyric, P2/P3 password→decrypts real next blob, P3.2 confession, SalPhaseIon chunks) and spiral (P0 genesis grid); Cosmic runs the REAL crypto and logs a frontier attempt. Solving cracks the door + awards XP.\r\n- Combined \"Overall champions\" board merges the Hive + Arcade by handle, both detailed boards kept separate (leaderboards.js)\r\n- root package.json {type:module} so Node imports the shared .js sims as ESM\r\n\r\nGovernance — maintainer-only control:\r\n- CODEOWNERS + protect-paths.yml (hard PR guard) + docs/GOVERNANCE.md lock data/**, .github/**, content/config.js to @HosterjackAGV\r\n- Untrack + gitignore all Claude files (CLAUDE.md stays local, never pushed)\r\n\r\nVerified: all modules node --check clean; sim + per-phase functional tests pass (assembled passwords decrypt the real phase3/phase32 blobs).",
